      "Wrong: Downloading everything and diffing it is the most expensive and slowest option, paying full egress on the entire dataset.",
      "Correct: Hashing locally and comparing against the CRC32C in the object metadata verifies integrity using metadata reads alone, with no download and no egress cost."
