    "correctRationale": "In Google Cloud, an IAM policy at a parent node is inherited by every descendant, and the effective permissions are the union of all applicable bindings. Granting a narrower role such as Viewer further down adds permissions; it never subtracts the Owner role inherited from the organization. The only way to stop the team creating resources in Finance is to remove the organization-level Owner binding and re-grant Owner only on the Shopping folder.",
