    "discussionSummary": "Consensus B: GKE's per-node logging agent already collects container stdout into Cloud Logging, so there is no need to attach to a container, and serial console output does not include stdout.",
    "conceptSummary": "Reading logs from a Pod that keeps crash-looping.",
