    "discussionSummary": "Heavily contested. The most-voted comments favour A, since Cloud SQL for SQL Server now supports high availability. The counter-argument, and the validated answer, is D: Cloud SQL failover still takes one to two minutes, which is not the required zero downtime, and Cloud SQL HA for SQL Server did not exist when the question was written.",
    "conceptSummary": "No downtime versus reduced downtime for SQL Server across zones.",
