    "correctRationale": "Two characteristics decide this. The volume of change is high, since a 4 TB database with frequent large updates generates continuous replication traffic that a single VPN tunnel's few gigabits per second would struggle to keep up with. And the traffic must use private addressing over a link that does not traverse the public internet. Dedicated Interconnect provides a private physical circuit at 10 Gbps or more terminating in your VPC, satisfying both.",
